  "body": "## Summary\r\n\r\n- Discover conventional Cargo directory integration targets (`tests/<suite>/main.rs`) alongside flat suites, following declared modules rather than treating neighboring support files as independent targets.\r\n- Keep quick changes scoped to their owning suite and to qualified changed test functions when precise. Check both preimage and postimage hunk spans; structural, missing-preimage and conditional-source changes fall back conservatively.\r\n- Run named directory tests through `gate test`, preserving nested/inline/`#[path]` qualification, duplicate leaf names and ignored/heavy selection. Documentation mentioning `#[ignore]` does not turn an ordinary test into a heavy test.\r\n- Isolate real Cargo fixture outputs by source-root identity. Increment `PROCESS_VERSION` from 30 to 31 and record the decision in `docs/decisions/927-directory-test-suites.md`.\r\n\r\n## Validation\r\n\r\nUsed the repository-permitted targeted alternative: the touched xtask test binary plus touched-crate all-target Clippy.\r\n\r\n- `cargo test -p xtask -- --nocapture`: **73 passed, 0 failed, 0 ignored**.\r\n- Five real Cargo directory-suite selections executed nonzero counts: default **1**, nested **1**, comment-brace module **1**, duplicate leaf names **2**, aliased module path **1**. Three independent fixtures have distinct source roots, targets and executable paths; sequential selections of one unchanged fixture intentionally reuse its binary.\r\n- `cargo clippy -p xtask --all-targets -- -D warnings`: passed.\r\n- Focused `rustfmt --check --edition 2024 --config skip_children=true` on the eight changed implementation/new-test modules: passed. Three legacy test-adapter initializers retain their existing formatting; diff whitespace checks pass.\r\n- Sequential independent review of the complete contribution and correction delta: no remaining actionable findings. Regressions include `documented_ignore_examples_are_not_ignore_attributes` and `quick_checks_old_and_new_hunk_sides_without_widening_in_test_edits`.\r\n\r\nValidation ran on native Windows against the exact final committed tree. No application/full/release suite, other-platform run, test migration or hosted workflow was requested or executed.\r\n\r\n## Readings and scope\r\n\r\nCurrent repository AGENTS/README/work-issue rules, Cargo Book package layout, rustc Book test filtering, and #919's linked research. This implements only the directory-suite prerequisite, not #919's test consolidation or crate moves. No dependency or workflow changes.\r\n\r\nEffort: medium\r\nChangelog: xtask recognizes directory test suites and keeps quick and named test selection scoped to their qualified tests.\r\n\r\nFixes #927\r\n",
